    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 17th level, the cartomancer may use her tell fortune class feature as a full-round action; however, all benefits, and penalties, granted by the fortune only last for 1 minute per cartomancer level. The mark must still consent to have his fortune taken.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancer#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
